</table>

<para id="fs-id1313011">Identitas kedua dan ketiga dapat diperoleh dengan memanipulasi identitas pertama. Identitas  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  diperoleh dengan menulis ulang ruas kiri persamaan dalam bentuk sinus dan kosinus.</para>
<para id="fs-id1297940"> Buktikan: <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>

<equation id="fs-id1286496" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cot</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Tulis ulang sisi kiri</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Tulis kedua suku dengan penyebut yang sama</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>csc</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1693712">Demikian juga, <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dapat diperoleh dengan cara serupa, yaitu menulis ulang ruas kiri identitas ini dalam bentuk sinus dan kosinus. Hasilnya adalah</para>
<equation id="fs-id1734133" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>Tulis ulang sisi kiri</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>Tulis kedua suku dengan penyebut yang sama</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1981287">Kelompok identitas dasar berikutnya adalah  <emphasis>identitas genap-ganjil.  </emphasis> <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">identitas genap-ganjil</term>  menghubungkan nilai fungsi trigonometri pada suatu sudut dengan nilai fungsi tersebut pada sudut yang berlawanan, serta menentukan apakah fungsinya ganjil atau genap. (Lihat  <link target-id="Table_07_01_02" />).</para>

<table id="Table_07_01_02" summary="&quot;Identitas Genap-Ganjil&quot; dengan tiga sel. Pertama: tan(-theta) = -tan(theta) dan cot(-theta) = -cot(theta). Kedua: sin(-theta) = -sin(theta) dan csc(-theta) = -csc(theta). Ketiga: cos(-theta) = cos(theta) dan sec(-theta) = sec(theta).">
<tgroup cols="3"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<thead>
<row>
<entry namest="c1" nameend="c3" align="center">Identitas Genap-Ganjil</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>

<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>

</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>

</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>

</entry>
</row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table>


<para id="fs-id2261790">Ingatlah bahwa <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">fungsi ganjil</term>  memenuhi  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(−</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>= −</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> untuk semua <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dalam domain  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Fungsi  <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004">sinus</term>  merupakan fungsi ganjil karena  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Grafik fungsi ganjil simetris terhadap titik asal. Sebagai contoh, perhatikan pasangan masukan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Nilai keluaran untuk  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  merupakan lawan dari nilai keluaran untuk  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> Jadi,</para>

<equation id="fs-id1250340" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mtext>dan</m:mtext></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1348168">Hal ini ditunjukkan pada  <link target-id="Figure_07_01_002" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_01_002" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1491023" alt="Grafik y=sin(theta) dari -2pi hingga 2pi yang menunjukkan bahwa grafik simetris terhadap titik asal. Titik-titik yang diberikan adalah (pi/2, 1) dan (-pi/2, -1).">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_01_002-a36c.jpg" />
</media>
<caption>Grafik  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</caption>
</figure>

<para id="fs-id1017824">Ingatlah bahwa <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">fungsi genap</term>  memenuhi</para>
<equation id="fs-id1369369" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtext> untuk semua </m:mtext><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext>  dalam domain  </m:mtext><m:mi>f</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id1557117">Grafik fungsi genap simetris terhadap sumbu-<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>. Fungsi kosinus merupakan fungsi genap karena <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>

Sebagai contoh, perhatikan pasangan masukan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>4</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>4</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Nilai keluaran untuk  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>4</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  sama dengan nilai keluaran untuk  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>4</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> Jadi,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1371573" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>4</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mi>π</m:mi>
<m:mn>4</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>              </m:mtext><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.707</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1938940">Lihat  <link target-id="Figure_07_01_003" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_01_003" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1157926" alt="Grafik y=cos(theta) dari -2pi hingga 2pi yang menunjukkan bahwa grafik simetris terhadap sumbu y. Titik-titik yang diberikan adalah (-pi/4, 0,707) dan (pi/4, 0,707). ">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_01_003.jpg" />
</media>
<caption>Grafik  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>

</caption>
</figure>

<para id="fs-id1194483">Untuk semua <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dalam domain fungsi sinus dan kosinus secara berturut-turut, kita dapat menyatakan hal berikut:</para>
<list id="fs-id2141576"><item>Karena  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>  sinus merupakan fungsi ganjil.</item>
<item>Karena  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(−</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  kosinus merupakan fungsi genap.</item>
</list><para id="fs-id1980806">Identitas genap-ganjil lainnya mengikuti sifat genap dan ganjil fungsi sinus dan kosinus. Sebagai contoh, perhatikan identitas tangen,  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(−</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>−tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Tangen sudut negatif dapat kita tafsirkan sebagai  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(−</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(−</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Oleh karena itu, tangen merupakan fungsi ganjil, yang berarti bahwa  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> untuk semua <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dalam domain  <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">fungsi tangen</term>.</para><para id="fs-id2077664">Identitas kotangen,  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  juga mengikuti identitas sinus dan kosinus. Kotangen sudut negatif dapat kita tafsirkan sebagai  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Oleh karena itu, kotangen merupakan fungsi ganjil, yang berarti bahwa  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> untuk semua <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dalam domain  <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">fungsi kotangen</term>.</para><para id="fs-id2723404">Fungsi  <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">kosekan</term>  merupakan resiprokal fungsi sinus, sehingga kosekan sudut negatif ditafsirkan sebagai  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Oleh karena itu, fungsi kosekan merupakan fungsi ganjil.</para><para id="fs-id2082526">Terakhir, fungsi sekan merupakan resiprokal fungsi kosinus, dan sekan sudut negatif ditafsirkan sebagai  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Oleh karena itu, fungsi sekan merupakan fungsi genap.  </para>
<para id="fs-id1672703">Singkatnya, hanya dua fungsi trigonometri, yaitu kosinus dan sekan, yang merupakan fungsi genap. Empat fungsi lainnya merupakan fungsi ganjil; hal ini memverifikasi identitas genap-ganjil.</para>
<para id="fs-id1419861">Kelompok identitas dasar berikutnya adalah  <term id="term-00009">identitas resiprokal</term>, yang sesuai namanya menghubungkan fungsi-fungsi trigonometri yang saling resiprokal. Lihat  <link target-id="fs-id2031263" />.</para><table id="fs-id2031263" summary="Tabel berlabel &quot;Identitas Resiprokal&quot;. Tiga baris dan dua kolom. Tabel memuat pasangan terurut nilai-nilai berikut: (sin(theta) = 1/csc(theta), csc(theta) = 1/sin(theta)), (cos(theta) = 1/sec(theta), sec(theta) = 1/cos(theta)), (tan(theta) = 1/cot(theta), cot(theta) = 1/tan(theta)).">
<tgroup cols="3"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<thead>
<row>
<entry namest="c1" nameend="c3" align="center">Identitas Resiprokal</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>

<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
</row>


<row>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table>


<para id="fs-id1354190">Kelompok identitas terakhir adalah  <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00010">identitas hasil bagi</term>, yang mendefinisikan hubungan di antara fungsi-fungsi trigonometri tertentu dan sangat membantu untuk memverifikasi identitas lain. Lihat  <link target-id="fs-id937819" />.</para><table id="fs-id937819" summary="Tabel berlabel &quot;Identitas Hasil Bagi&quot;. Sel pertama: tan(theta) = sin(theta) / cos(theta). Sel kedua: cot(theta) = cos(theta) / sin(theta).">
<title />
<tgroup cols="3"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<thead>
<row>
<entry namest="c1" nameend="c3" align="center">Identitas Hasil Bagi
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>


<para id="fs-id1921100">Identitas resiprokal dan identitas hasil bagi diturunkan dari definisi fungsi-fungsi trigonometri dasar.</para>

<note id="fs-id1403866">
<title>Ringkasan Identitas Trigonometri</title>

<para id="fs-id1389829"> <term id="term-00011">Identitas Pythagoras</term> didasarkan pada sifat segitiga siku-siku.</para>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_01" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_02" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_03" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id2769070"> <term id="term-00012">Identitas genap-ganjil</term> mengaitkan nilai fungsi trigonometri pada sudut tertentu dengan nilai fungsi pada sudut yang berlawanan.</para>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_04" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_05" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_06" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><equation id="Equation_07_01_07" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_08" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_09" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id1528559"> <term id="term-00013">Identitas resiprokal</term>  mendefinisikan resiprokal fungsi-fungsi trigonometri.</para>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_10" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_11" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_12" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_13" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_14" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_15" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id1343265"> <term id="term-00014">Identitas hasil bagi</term> menentukan hubungan antara fungsi trigonometri.</para>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_16" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="Equation_07_01_17" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
</note><example id="Example_07_01_01">
<exercise id="fs-id1194554"><problem id="fs-id1616347">
<title>Menggambar Grafik Kedua Ekspresi dalam Suatu Identitas</title>
<para id="fs-id1693457">Gambarkan kedua ruas identitas  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Dengan kata lain, pada kalkulator grafik, gambarkan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1208452">


<para id="fs-id1859063">Lihat  <link target-id="Figure_07_01_007" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_07_01_007" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1353869" alt="Grafik y = cot(theta) dan y = 1/tan(theta) dari -2pi hingga 2pi. Kedua grafik itu sama!">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_01_007.jpg" />
</media>
</figure></solution>
<commentary id="fs-id1581724">
<title>Analisis </title>
<para id="fs-id3063508">Kita hanya melihat satu grafik karena kedua ekspresi menghasilkan gambar yang sama; satu grafik bertumpuk tepat di atas yang lain. Ini merupakan cara yang baik untuk mengonfirmasi identitas yang telah diverifikasi secara analitis. Jika kedua ekspresi menghasilkan grafik yang sama, kemungkinan besar keduanya merupakan identitas.</para></commentary>
</exercise></example>

<note id="fs-id2467864" class="how-to-notitle">
<label>Cara</label>
<para id="fs-id693742"><emphasis>Jika diberikan suatu identitas trigonometri, verifikasilah bahwa identitas tersebut benar.
</emphasis></para>
<list id="fs-id2191946" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
<item>Kerjakan salah satu ruas persamaan. Biasanya lebih baik memulai dari ruas yang lebih rumit karena lebih mudah menyederhanakan suatu ekspresi daripada membangunnya.</item>
<item>Cari peluang untuk memfaktorkan ekspresi, menguadratkan binomial, atau menjumlahkan pecahan.</item>
<item>Dengan memperhatikan fungsi yang terdapat dalam ekspresi akhir, cari peluang untuk menggunakan identitas dan melakukan substitusi yang tepat.</item>
<item>Jika langkah-langkah ini belum menghasilkan bentuk yang diinginkan, cobalah mengubah semua suku menjadi sinus dan kosinus.</item>
</list>
</note>

<example id="Example_07_01_02">
<exercise id="fs-id3057901">
<problem id="fs-id2291660">
<title>Memverifikasi Identitas Trigonometri</title>
<para id="fs-id1947320">Verifikasi  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1334614">


<para id="fs-id1213512">Kita akan mulai dari sisi kiri, karena itu adalah sisi yang lebih rumit:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1732674" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:menclose>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
<commentary id="fs-id1149916">
<title>Analisis </title>


<para id="fs-id1266264">Identitas ini cukup mudah diverifikasi karena kita hanya perlu menulis  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> dalam hal <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</commentary>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id820368" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_01_01"><problem id="fs-id2335257"><para id="fs-id2335258">Verifikasi identitas  <m:math>
 <m:mrow><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1237705">
<equation id="fs-id2822559" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise></note>

<example id="Example_07_01_03">
<exercise id="fs-id2066731">
<problem id="fs-id1128511">
<title>Memverifikasi Kesetaraan dengan Identitas Genap-Ganjil</title>
<para id="fs-id937635">Verifikasi kesetaraan berikut menggunakan identitas genap-ganjil:</para>
<equation id="fs-id2463271" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1492841">
<para id="fs-id1137525">Dengan mengolah ruas kiri persamaan, kita memperoleh  </para>


<equation id="fs-id1277815" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>Karena sin(−</m:mtext><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext>)=</m:mtext><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                                      </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>Selisih kuadrat</m:mtext>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                                      </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>cos</m:mtext>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<example id="Example_07_01_04">
<exercise id="fs-id1758470"><problem id="fs-id1233021">
<title>Memverifikasi identitas trigonometri yang melibatkan <emphasis effect="italics">sec<sup>2</sup>θ</emphasis></title>
<para id="fs-id2814564">Memverifikasi identitas <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2123498">


<para id="fs-id2123500">Karena sisi kiri lebih rumit, mari kita mulai dari sana.</para>


<equation id="fs-id2081326" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>sec</m:mtext>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd>
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd>
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>tan</m:mtext>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:menclose>

</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:menclose>
<m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1244586">Ada lebih dari satu cara untuk memverifikasi identitas. Ada kemungkinan lain. Sekali lagi, kita bisa mulai dari sisi kiri.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2107026" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
<commentary id="fs-id1414116">
<title>Analisis </title>
<para id="fs-id1698743">Dalam metode pertama, kita menggunakan identitas <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> lalu melanjutkan penyederhanaan. Pada metode kedua, kita memisahkan pecahan dengan menempatkan setiap suku pembilang di atas penyebut yang sama. Masalah ini menunjukkan bahwa terdapat beberapa cara untuk memverifikasi identitas. Sedikit kreativitas kadang-kadang dapat menyederhanakan prosedur. Selama substitusinya benar, jawabannya akan sama.</para>
</commentary>
</exercise></example>

<note id="fs-id2017058" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_01_02"><problem id="fs-id1185914"><para id="fs-id1185915">Tunjukkan bahwa  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1506268"><equation id="fs-id1506270" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise></note>

<example id="Example_07_01_05">
<exercise id="fs-id2122140">
<problem id="fs-id1970227">
<title>Membuat dan Memverifikasi Identitas</title>
<para id="fs-id1970233">Buat identitas untuk ekspresi <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan menulis ulang secara ketat dalam hal sinus.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1429666">


<para id="fs-id1429668">Ada beberapa cara untuk memulai, tetapi di sini kita akan menggunakan identitas hasil bagi dan resiprokal untuk menulis ulang ekspresi:</para>
<equation id="fs-id2338806" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Substitusikan </m:mtext><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mtext> sebagai pengganti </m:mtext><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id2715698">Jadi,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1713659" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<example id="Example_07_01_06">
<exercise id="fs-id1219228">
<problem id="fs-id1219230">
<title>Memverifikasi Identitas dengan Aljabar dan Identitas Genap-Ganjil</title>
<para id="fs-id2430931">Verifikasi identitas:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1583958" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2345275">


<para id="fs-id2345277">Mari kita mulai dari sisi kiri dan menyederhanakan:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1540225" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
             <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(−</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mtext>dan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Selisih kuadrat</m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id2137172" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_01_03">
<problem id="fs-id2261720">
<para id="fs-id2261721">Verifikasilah identitas <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>

<solution id="fs-id2701905"><para id="fs-id2701906"> <m:math>
<m:mtable>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
</m:mtable>

</m:math>
</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>

<example id="Example_07_01_07">
<exercise id="fs-id1664723">
<problem id="fs-id1664725">
<title>Memverifikasi Identitas yang Melibatkan Kosinus dan Kotangen </title>
<para id="fs-id1664730">Verifikasi identitas: <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1913600">


<para id="fs-id1913602">Kita akan bekerja di sisi kiri persamaan.</para>

<equation id="fs-id1913605" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" />
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>Tentukan penyebut yang sama</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                                     </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise>
</example>
</section><section id="fs-id2485952">
<title>Menggunakan Aljabar untuk Menyederhanakan Ekspresi Trigonometri</title>
<para id="fs-id2485958">Kita telah melihat bahwa aljabar sangat penting untuk memverifikasi identitas trigonometri, dan sama pentingnya untuk menyederhanakan ekspresi trigonometri sebelum penyelesaian. Keakraban dengan sifat dan rumus dasar aljabar, seperti rumus selisih kuadrat, rumus kuadrat sempurna, atau substitusi, akan menyederhanakan pekerjaan yang melibatkan ekspresi dan persamaan trigonometri.</para>
<para id="fs-id2485964">Misalnya, persamaan <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> mirip dengan persamaan <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  yang menggunakan bentuk terfaktor dari selisih kuadrat. Penggunaan aljabar membuat pencarian solusi menjadi langsung dan akrab. Kita dapat menyamakan setiap faktor dengan nol lalu menyelesaikannya. Ini merupakan salah satu contoh pengenalan pola aljabar dalam ekspresi atau persamaan trigonometri.</para><para id="fs-id1814865">Contoh lain adalah rumus selisih kuadrat, <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mi>a</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mi>b</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> yang banyak digunakan dalam berbagai bidang di luar matematika, seperti teknik, arsitektur, dan fisika. Kita juga dapat membuat identitas sendiri dengan terus mengembangkan suatu ekspresi dan melakukan substitusi yang sesuai. Penggunaan sifat dan rumus aljabar membuat banyak persamaan trigonometri lebih mudah dipahami dan diselesaikan.</para><example id="Example_07_01_08">
<exercise id="fs-id1814944">
<problem id="fs-id2578086"><title>Menulis Ekspresi Trigonometri sebagai Ekspresi Aljabar</title>

<para id="fs-id2578091">Tulislah ekspresi trigonometri berikut sebagai ekspresi aljabar: <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2578132">


<para id="fs-id2578134">Perhatikan bahwa pola yang ditampilkan memiliki bentuk yang sama dengan ekspresi kuadrat standar, <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Dengan memisalkan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> kita bisa menulis ulang ungkapan sebagai berikut:</para>
<equation id="fs-id2121948" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id2121978">Ekspresi ini dapat difaktorkan menjadi  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Jika ekspresi itu disamakan dengan nol dan kita ingin menyelesaikan persamaannya, kita akan menggunakan sifat faktor nol dan menyelesaikan setiap faktor untuk  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> Pada titik ini, kita akan menggantikan <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dengan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> dan menyelesaikan untuk <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<example id="Example_07_05_09">
<exercise id="fs-id2721228">
<problem id="fs-id2721230">
<title>Menulis Ulang Ekspresi Trigonometri Menggunakan Selisih Kuadrat </title>
<para id="fs-id1777385">Tulis ulang ekspresi trigonometri: <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1777420">

<para id="fs-id1777422">Perhatikan bahwa koefisien maupun ekspresi trigonometri pada suku pertama dikuadratkan, dan kuadrat bilangan 1 adalah 1. Ini merupakan selisih kuadrat. Jadi,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1777427" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                  </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
<commentary id="fs-id1739635">
<title>Analisis </title>


<para id="fs-id1739641">Jika ekspresi ini ditulis sebagai persamaan yang disamakan dengan nol, kita dapat menyelesaikan setiap faktor menggunakan sifat faktor nol. Kita juga dapat menggunakan substitusi seperti pada masalah sebelumnya dengan memisalkan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> menulis ulang ungkapan sebagai <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan memfaktorkan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> Kemudian ganti <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dengan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  lalu menyelesaikan sudutnya.</para></commentary>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id2438482" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_01_04">
<problem id="fs-id2438492"><para id="fs-id2438493">Tulis ulang ekspresi trigonometri: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2438529">
<para id="fs-id2438532">Ini adalah rumus selisih kuadrat: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>

<example id="Example_07_01_10">
<exercise id="fs-id2917234">
<problem id="fs-id2917236">
<title>Menyederhanakan dengan Menulis Ulang dan Menggunakan Substitusi</title>
<para id="fs-id2917242">Sederhanakan ekspresi dengan menulis ulang dan menggunakan identitas:</para>
<equation id="fs-id2917245" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2483936">


<para id="fs-id2483938">Kita bisa mulai dengan identitas Pythagoras.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2483941" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id2483988">Sekarang kita dapat menyederhanakan dengan mensubstitusikan <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> sebagai pengganti <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  Kita memperoleh</para>
<equation id="fs-id2873062" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id2607392" class="precalculus try">
<label>Cobalah</label>
<exercise id="ti_07_01_05"><problem id="fs-id2607401"><para id="fs-id2607402">Gunakan teknik aljabar untuk memverifikasi identitas: <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
<para id="fs-id2780700">(Petunjuk: Kalikan pembilang dan penyebut pada ruas kiri dengan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2780726">
<equation id="fs-id2780728" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                               </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mtext>                               </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
</exercise></note>

<note id="fs-id1646590" class="precalculus media media-notitle">
<label>Media</label>
<para id="fs-id1646597">Akses sumber daya daring berikut untuk memperoleh penjelasan dan latihan tambahan tentang identitas trigonometri dasar.</para>
<list id="fs-id1646601">
<item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/funtrigiden">Identitas Trigonometri Dasar</link></item>
<item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/verifytrigiden">Memverifikasi Identitas Trigonometri</link></item></list>
</note>
</section>

<section id="fs-id2056229" class="key-equations"><title>Persamaan Utama</title><table id="fs-id2056235" summary="Tabel empat baris yang merangkum Identitas Pythagoras, Identitas Genap-Ganjil, Identitas Resiprokal, dan Identitas Hasil Bagi." class="unnumbered unstyled"><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center">Identitas Pythagoras</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:msup>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
</m:mtable>

</m:math>
</entry>
</row>


<row>
<entry align="center">Identitas Genap-Ganjil</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi></m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
</m:mtable>

</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center">Identitas Resiprokal</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
<m:mtd>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
</m:mtable>

</m:math>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center">Identitas Hasil Bagi</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mtable columnalign="left">
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow />
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr columnalign="left">
<m:mtd columnalign="left">
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:mtd>
</m:mtr>

</m:mtable>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
</row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></section><section id="fs-id2081298" class="key-concepts">
<title>Konsep Utama</title>
<list id="fs-id2081305">
<item>Ada beberapa cara untuk mewakili ekspresi trigonometri. Memverifikasi identitas menunjukkan bagaimana ekspresi dapat ditulis ulang untuk menyederhanakan masalah.</item>
<item>Menggambar grafik kedua ruas identitas akan memverifikasinya. Lihat  <link target-id="Example_07_01_01" />.</item>
<item>Menyederhanakan satu sisi persamaan untuk sama dengan sisi lain adalah metode lain untuk memverifikasi identitas. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_01_02" />  dan  <link target-id="Example_07_01_03" />.</item>
<item>Pendekatan untuk memverifikasi identitas bergantung pada bentuk identitas tersebut. Sering kali berguna untuk memulai dari ruas persamaan yang lebih rumit. Lihat  <link target-id="Example_07_01_04" />.</item>
<item>Kita bisa menciptakan identitas dengan menyederhanakan ekspresi dan kemudian memverifikasinya. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_01_05" />.</item>
<item>Memverifikasi identitas mungkin melibatkan aljabar dengan identitas dasar. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_01_06" /> dan <link target-id="Example_07_01_07" />.</item>
<item>Teknik aljabar dapat digunakan untuk menyederhanakan ekspresi trigonometri. Teknik ini digunakan di seluruh buku karena mencakup aturan-aturan dasar matematika. Lihat  <link target-id="Example_07_01_08" />, <link target-id="Example_07_05_09" />, dan <link target-id="Example_07_01_10" />.</item>
</list></section>

<section id="fs-id2347805" class="section-exercises">
<title>Latihan Bagian</title><section id="fs-id2347808">
<title>Verbal</title>
<exercise id="fs-id2347813" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2347814"><para id="fs-id2347815">Kita mengetahui bahwa  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah fungsi genap, dan <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  merupakan fungsi ganjil. Bagaimana dengan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>G</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>F</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>H</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> ? Apakah keduanya genap, ganjil, atau bukan keduanya? Mengapa?</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2116116">
<para id="fs-id2116118">Ketiga fungsi,  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>F</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>G</m:mi></m:math>, dan <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>H</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  merupakan fungsi genap.</para><para id="eip-id1868065">Ini karena <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>F</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>F</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>G</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>G</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>  dan  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>H</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>H</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>

</para>
</solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1880650" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1880651"><para id="fs-id1880652">Periksa grafik dari <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> pada interval <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> Bagaimana kita bisa tahu apakah fungsi itu genap atau ganjil hanya dengan mengamati grafik dari <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2431723" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2431724"><para id="fs-id2431726">Setelah memeriksa identitas resiprokal untuk <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> jelaskan mengapa fungsi tersebut tidak terdefinisi pada titik-titik tertentu.</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2431745">
<para id="fs-id2431747">Ketika  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> maka <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mn>0</m:mn>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> yang tidak terdefinisi. </para></solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2431799" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2431800"><para id="fs-id2431801">Semua Identitas Pythagoras saling berkaitan. Jelaskan cara memanipulasi persamaan untuk beralih dari <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> ke bentuk-bentuk lainnya.</para></problem></exercise>

</section>
<section id="fs-id2796234">
<title>Aljabar</title>
<para id="fs-id2796239">Untuk latihan berikut, gunakan identitas dasar untuk menyederhanakan ekspresi sepenuhnya.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id2796242"><problem id="fs-id2796243"><para id="fs-id2796244"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2796267">
<para id="fs-id2796269"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2796285"><problem id="fs-id2796286"><para id="fs-id2796287"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id2170891"><problem id="fs-id2170892"><para id="fs-id2170893"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2170933">
<para id="fs-id2170935"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2170950" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2170951"><para id="fs-id2170952"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id2170985" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2170986"><para id="fs-id2170987"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1685204">
<para id="fs-id1685206"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>t</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1685221" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1685222"><para id="fs-id1685223"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id1685297" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1685298"><para id="fs-id1685299"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1799282">
<para id="fs-id1799284"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>−1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1799299" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1799300"><para id="fs-id1799301"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id1799362" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1799363"><para id="fs-id1799364"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2550286">
<para id="fs-id2550288"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2550314" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2550315"><para id="fs-id2550316"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2438284" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2438285"><para id="fs-id2438286"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2438361">
<para id="fs-id2438363"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>


<para id="fs-id2438393">Untuk latihan berikut, sederhanakan ekspresi trigonometri pertama dengan menuliskan bentuk sederhananya dalam bentuk ekspresi kedua.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id2438397"><problem id="fs-id2438398"><para id="fs-id2438400"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2641075"><problem id="fs-id2641076"><para id="fs-id2641077"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2641126">
<para id="fs-id2641128"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2641154"><problem id="fs-id2641155"><para id="fs-id2641156"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1408283" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1408284"><para id="fs-id1408285"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1408328">
<para id="fs-id1408331"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1408355" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1408356"><para id="fs-id1408357"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1408421" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1408422"><para id="fs-id1408423"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1775770">
<para id="fs-id1775772"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1775788" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1775789"><para id="fs-id1775790"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext>  dan  </m:mtext><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1775836" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1775837"><para id="fs-id1775838"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mtext>  dan  </m:mtext><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2159351">
<para id="fs-id2159353"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2159377" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2159378"><para id="fs-id2159379"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2159401"><problem id="fs-id2159402"><para id="fs-id2159404"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2159426">
<para id="fs-id2159428"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:msqrt>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id3239563"><problem id="fs-id3239564"><para id="fs-id3239565"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id3239588"><problem id="fs-id3239589"><para id="fs-id3239590"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id3239612">
<para id="fs-id3239614"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>±</m:mo><m:msqrt>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:msqrt>

</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id3239668"><problem id="fs-id3239669"><para id="fs-id3239670"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>


<para id="fs-id3239692">Untuk latihan berikut, periksa identitasnya.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id3239695" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id3239696"><para id="fs-id3239698"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1271421">
<para id="fs-id1271423">Jawaban dapat bervariasi. Contoh pembuktian:</para>
<para id="eip-id2078625"> <m:math><m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
<m:mn>3</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math> <newline />

 <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id2955162" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2955163"><para id="fs-id2955164"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2955223" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2955224"><para id="fs-id2955225"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2558764">
<para id="fs-id2558767"> Jawaban dapat bervariasi. Contoh pembuktian:<newline /> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2777843" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2777844"><para id="fs-id2777845"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2242102" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2242103"><para id="fs-id2242104"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2242184">
<para id="fs-id2242186"> Jawaban dapat bervariasi. Contoh pembuktian:<newline />
 <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution></exercise>

</section>
<section id="fs-id3240672">
<title>Pengayaan</title>


<para id="fs-id3240678">Untuk latihan berikut, buktikan atau sangkal identitas tersebut.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id3240681" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id3240682"><para id="fs-id3240683"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2595511" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2595512"><para id="fs-id2595513"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>csc</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2595584">
<para id="fs-id2595586">Salah</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2595591" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2595592"><para id="fs-id2595593"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sec</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1812346" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1812347"><para id="fs-id1812348"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1812412">
<para id="fs-id1812414">Salah</para>
</solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1812418" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1812419"><para id="fs-id1812420"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2791132" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2791133"><para id="fs-id2791134"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>

</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2791207">
<para id="fs-id2791209">Dibuktikan dengan identitas negatif dan Identitas Pythagoras</para></solution>
</exercise>

<para id="fs-id2791214">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan apakah identitas tersebut benar atau salah. Jika salah, carilah ekspresi ekuivalen yang sesuai.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id2791219" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2791220"><para id="fs-id2791221"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cos</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>tan</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sin</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2427617" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2427618"><para id="fs-id2427619"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2427687">
<para id="fs-id2427689">Benar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

</para></solution></exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2575546"><problem id="fs-id2575547"><para id="fs-id2575548"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mfrac>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>sec</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mn>2</m:mn>
</m:msup>
<m:mi>θ</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>

</section>
</section>

</content>
<glossary>
<definition id="fs-id1881971">
<term>identitas genap-ganjil</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1881976">himpunan persamaan yang melibatkan fungsi trigonometri sedemikian sehingga jika  <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> identitasnya ganjil, dan jika <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:mrow>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
<m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
</m:mrow>
</m:math> identitasnya genap</meaning></definition>
<definition id="fs-id1882066">
<term>Identitas Pythagoras</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1882069">himpunan persamaan yang melibatkan fungsi trigonometri berdasarkan sifat segitiga siku-siku</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1882073">
<term>identitas hasil bagi</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1882076">pasangan identitas berdasarkan fakta bahwa tangen adalah rasio sinus terhadap kosinus, sedangkan kotangen adalah rasio kosinus terhadap sinus</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1882080">
<term>identitas resiprokal</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1882083">himpunan persamaan yang melibatkan resiprokal dari definisi-definisi trigonometri dasar</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
</document>